# Notify on push / PR

Whenever you **push** to a remote, **create** a PR, or **update** a PR (description / draft→ready / URL), tell the user in the same turn:

- What you did (push / open PR / update PR)
- Branch name
- PR URL (if any)
- Short what landed (1 line)

Do this even when the push/PR was already authorized by `ok` / workflow SOP. Never silently push or open a PR.
